1
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:48,020
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,070 --> 00:01:51,000
[Episode 11]

3
00:01:55,420 --> 00:01:57,400
Someone actually secretly took photos?

4
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,310
Uncle and Lili

5
00:01:58,310 --> 00:01:59,450
are quite a match.

6
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:02,200
I was only gone for a little while,

7
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,330
and they've made such rapid progress.

8
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,480
It's just that dating

9
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,290
is really tough

10
00:02:07,290 --> 00:02:08,750
for these two introverts.

11
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:10,380
Hey, handsome!

12
00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:11,280
We've met before

13
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,500
at EAW.

14
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:23,620
Are you okay?

15
00:02:25,750 --> 00:02:27,400
Call... Call an ambulance.

16
00:02:42,090 --> 00:02:43,000
Fu Zhengchu!

17
00:02:43,210 --> 00:02:44,020
I...

18
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:48,210
How did you get hurt so badly?

19
00:02:48,650 --> 00:02:50,370
Let alone skateboarding,

20
00:02:50,410 --> 00:02:51,940
even walking is a struggle.

21
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:55,020
For the rest of your life,

22
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:57,810
you won't be confined to a wheelchair,
will you?

23
00:03:00,210 --> 00:03:01,020
Tang Lin.

24
00:03:03,300 --> 00:03:04,090
I'm here.

25
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,500
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

26
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:11,230
I mistook you for someone else.

27
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:19,610
Well, how's your leg?

28
00:03:20,500 --> 00:03:21,210
It's fine.

29
00:03:21,210 --> 00:03:21,910
It'll be better in a few days.

30
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:22,650
Minor issue.

31
00:03:22,750 --> 00:03:23,560
Don't worry.

32
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:35,860
You even snatched
a patient's potato chips?

33
00:03:36,690 --> 00:03:37,500
Forget it.

34
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,120
A real man doesn't pick fights with women.

35
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,820
Fine, you can have this bag of chips.

36
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:42,270
Too proud to admit it.

37
00:03:44,810 --> 00:03:45,620
But

38
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:46,400
why didn't my sister

39
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,300
come with you?

40
00:03:47,710 --> 00:03:48,750
Xia is busy.

41
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:50,000
She asked me to come see you.

42
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,260
She'll be here in a bit.

43
00:03:58,300 --> 00:03:59,020
I'm a little thirsty.

44
00:03:59,020 --> 00:04:00,690
Can you pour me some water?

45
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,800
You want me to pour water for you?

46
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:05,120
I'm injured, aren't I?

47
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,150
And it's hard to move my leg.

48
00:04:06,150 --> 00:04:07,750
Just help me pour some water.

49
00:04:11,500 --> 00:04:12,300
Help.

50
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,300
Alright, alright.

51
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,600
I'll pour some water for you.

52
00:04:32,750 --> 00:04:34,120
How exactly did you fall

53
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:35,320
to get hurt like this?

54
00:04:38,980 --> 00:04:39,770
Well,

55
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:42,070
there was this really ill-mannered person

56
00:04:42,070 --> 00:04:44,630
who actually threw
a banana peel on the road,

57
00:04:44,650 --> 00:04:45,770
causing me to fall.

58
00:04:46,270 --> 00:04:47,370
Otherwise, with my skills,

59
00:04:47,370 --> 00:04:48,600
I would never fall.

60
00:04:48,890 --> 00:04:50,300
What banana peel?

61
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:51,390
I think you just

62
00:04:51,390 --> 00:04:52,370
thought you were so skilled

63
00:04:52,370 --> 00:04:53,800
that you were scrolling on your phone

64
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:56,100
while skateboarding
and fell into a pit, right?

65
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:56,930
How did you...

66
00:04:58,990 --> 00:05:00,720
You must be Zhengchu's sister.

67
00:05:01,330 --> 00:05:02,130
Hello.

68
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:03,500
Just call me Feifei.

69
00:05:03,500 --> 00:05:04,240
Zhengchu,

70
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,240
I've paid the fees.

71
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,190
I'll be leaving now.

72
00:05:06,190 --> 00:05:06,930
Thanks.

73
00:05:06,930 --> 00:05:07,800
I'll transfer the money to you later.

74
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,830
Thanks for your help today.

75
00:05:08,830 --> 00:05:10,180
Then I'll come see you again tomorrow.

76
00:05:10,180 --> 00:05:10,630
Okay.

77
00:05:11,690 --> 00:05:12,590
Goodbye, Sister.

78
00:05:12,590 --> 00:05:13,410
Who is...

79
00:05:15,370 --> 00:05:16,370
Who is her sister?

80
00:05:16,890 --> 00:05:17,690
Fu Zhengchu,

81
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,600
who is she?

82
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:23,570
The knife. Move it back a bit.

83
00:05:27,730 --> 00:05:28,530
Who is she?

84
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:31,390
She's my lifesaver.

85
00:05:31,690 --> 00:05:32,800
Lifesaver?

86
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,330
Is your next line

87
00:05:33,330 --> 00:05:34,600
going to be that you have
nothing to repay her with,

88
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,100
so you'll offer yourself to her?

89
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:37,370
Have you been reading

90
00:05:37,370 --> 00:05:38,570
too many novels?

91
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:40,300
I fell into a pit,

92
00:05:40,300 --> 00:05:40,930
and she saved me

93
00:05:40,930 --> 00:05:42,240
and even called an ambulance for me.

94
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,570
You didn't look
where you were going, did you?

95
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:45,430
You deserved to fall into the pit.

96
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:49,600
What kind of nonsense is that?

97
00:05:54,690 --> 00:05:55,980
Do you know what I saw?

98
00:05:56,330 --> 00:05:57,100
Someone posted photos of Uncle

99
00:05:57,100 --> 00:05:58,150
and Lili

100
00:05:58,170 --> 00:05:59,050
online.

101
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:00,300
What are you talking—

102
00:06:01,390 --> 00:06:02,830
Look, they're such a good match.

103
00:06:02,830 --> 00:06:05,560
Their eyes were practically
glued to each other.

104
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,830
What do you know?

105
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:11,830
These are pink bubbles,

106
00:06:11,900 --> 00:06:13,100
the feeling of love.

107
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,430
These two

108
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:16,630
can finally be together

109
00:06:16,630 --> 00:06:17,390
openly.

110
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,730
The feeling of love.

111
00:06:22,280 --> 00:06:23,700
Why are you copying me?

112
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,150
Mrs. Jiang.

113
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,720
How is Grandma?

114
00:06:34,180 --> 00:06:35,270
She's fine.

115
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:36,750
Just some superficial wounds.

116
00:06:36,750 --> 00:06:38,360
The doctor was concerned
she might have a concussion,

117
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,980
so he recommended keeping her
in the hospital for observation.

118
00:06:39,980 --> 00:06:41,159
If nothing else comes up,

119
00:06:41,159 --> 00:06:42,420
she can be discharged.

120
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,970
That's good.

121
00:06:44,450 --> 00:06:45,159
Where's Uncle?

122
00:06:45,159 --> 00:06:46,159
He was busy for a long time,

123
00:06:46,159 --> 00:06:47,180
so he went home.

124
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:49,450
The old lady insisted on seeing you,

125
00:06:49,450 --> 00:06:51,180
so I had to call you over.

126
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,380
It's okay, Mrs. Jiang.

127
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:54,370
Where's Grandma?

128
00:06:54,370 --> 00:06:54,920
I'll go see her.

129
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:55,659
In the ward.

130
00:06:55,659 --> 00:06:56,720
Come with me.

131
00:06:59,120 --> 00:06:59,920
Mom,

132
00:07:00,060 --> 00:07:01,310
look who's here.

133
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:05,450
Yuan.

134
00:07:05,770 --> 00:07:07,220
Yuan, you're back.

135
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:08,720
Are you on school break?

136
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,370
Quick, sit down.

137
00:07:11,090 --> 00:07:11,880
Sit.

138
00:07:14,060 --> 00:07:14,860
Yes.

139
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:18,550
I came to see you
as soon as the holiday started.

140
00:07:20,180 --> 00:07:21,750
How are you feeling, Grandma?

141
00:07:21,750 --> 00:07:22,660
Does it hurt?

142
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,650
It doesn't hurt.

143
00:07:24,250 --> 00:07:25,420
As soon as I see you,

144
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:27,070
everything is fine.

145
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:30,220
She hasn't been eating well lately

146
00:07:30,270 --> 00:07:31,770
and keeps getting cranky.

147
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,900
I don't know what happened today.

148
00:07:33,930 --> 00:07:35,740
She just fell in the bathroom.

149
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:39,010
Why are you telling him this?

150
00:07:39,930 --> 00:07:41,130
Okay, I won't say it.

151
00:07:42,950 --> 00:07:43,750
Yuan,

152
00:07:43,770 --> 00:07:45,480
it's so hard

153
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,940
for me to get to see you.

154
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,659
You only come back

155
00:07:48,659 --> 00:07:50,120
once in a long while.

156
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,310
But you never stay long

157
00:07:52,310 --> 00:07:54,040
before you have to leave again.

158
00:07:56,690 --> 00:07:58,120
Do you have a lot

159
00:07:58,950 --> 00:08:00,270
going on at school?

160
00:08:01,420 --> 00:08:02,220
Or...

161
00:08:04,180 --> 00:08:05,510
are you dating someone?

162
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:09,050
Once you have a girlfriend,

163
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:10,980
you forget about me.

164
00:08:15,330 --> 00:08:17,060
I've just been too busy lately.

165
00:08:17,310 --> 00:08:18,620
When things settle down,

166
00:08:18,620 --> 00:08:19,950
I'll come see you often.

167
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,180
If you're dating,

168
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:25,810
you should spend time with the girl.

169
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:27,430
Girls

170
00:08:27,540 --> 00:08:29,470
need someone to keep them company.

171
00:08:29,980 --> 00:08:31,010
When the time comes,

172
00:08:31,010 --> 00:08:33,010
just bring her back

173
00:08:33,010 --> 00:08:34,169
to meet me.

174
00:08:35,169 --> 00:08:35,740
Okay.

175
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,840
Then promise me

176
00:08:41,440 --> 00:08:42,620
you'll eat well.

177
00:08:43,669 --> 00:08:44,480
Okay.

178
00:08:47,370 --> 00:08:48,170
Pinky swear.

179
00:08:49,530 --> 00:08:50,340
Pinky swear.

180
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:57,570
Patient in bed two, time for your checkup.

181
00:08:57,590 --> 00:08:58,400
Okay.

182
00:09:00,060 --> 00:09:00,880
Take it easy.

183
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:01,870
It's fine.

184
00:09:01,870 --> 00:09:02,530
Your shoes.

185
00:09:04,430 --> 00:09:05,050
Take it easy.

186
00:09:05,050 --> 00:09:05,670
Okay.

187
00:09:09,030 --> 00:09:10,770
Family members don't need to come along.

188
00:09:10,770 --> 00:09:11,480
After the checkup,

189
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,910
we'll bring her back.

190
00:09:12,910 --> 00:09:13,320
Okay.

191
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,170
Thank you.

192
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:19,910
Shize,

193
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:22,440
I'm really sorry

194
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,510
for making you come all this way at night.

195
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:26,080
I know you must be busy,

196
00:09:27,130 --> 00:09:28,740
so I won't hold you up.

197
00:09:28,740 --> 00:09:29,940
You should head back.

198
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,740
It's fine, Mrs. Jiang.

199
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,500
Taking care of Grandma

200
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,080
is what I should do.

201
00:09:36,630 --> 00:09:38,160
We're here, so don't worry.

202
00:09:39,980 --> 00:09:40,770
Go back.

203
00:09:45,510 --> 00:09:46,910
I'm leaving, Mrs. Jiang.

204
00:09:58,460 --> 00:09:59,250
Uncle.

205
00:10:01,460 --> 00:10:02,440
Why are you here?

206
00:10:03,620 --> 00:10:05,840
I came to see Grandma.

207
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,970
Whatever happens in our family

208
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,900
has nothing to do with you.

209
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,600
Do you know how she fell?

210
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:22,030
Mrs. Jiang told me

211
00:10:22,630 --> 00:10:24,390
Grandma fell in the bathroom.

212
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:27,700
She was just afraid you'd overthink it.

213
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,170
Today, your grandma

214
00:10:30,630 --> 00:10:32,840
wanted to look at Yuan's childhood photos,

215
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:35,240
so she stepped on a stool
to open the cabinet

216
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:36,600
and fell.

217
00:10:37,290 --> 00:10:38,750
On the way to the hospital,

218
00:10:38,750 --> 00:10:40,550
she even asked us not to tell Yuan

219
00:10:43,030 --> 00:10:44,960
because she was afraid he'd be sad.

220
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,080
Don't think

221
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:48,100
a quick visit here

222
00:10:48,100 --> 00:10:49,890
makes everything fine.

223
00:10:51,100 --> 00:10:53,230
You just want peace of mind, don't you?

224
00:10:53,500 --> 00:10:54,250
So you can go back

225
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:55,630
to your own life.

226
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,050
But we still have to

227
00:10:57,050 --> 00:10:58,750
bear all this mess ourselves!

228
00:11:02,460 --> 00:11:04,000
What are you doing, Jiang?

229
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,490
We're in a hospital.

230
00:11:05,490 --> 00:11:06,270
Why were you yelling?

231
00:11:06,270 --> 00:11:07,870
You were disturbing others.

232
00:11:09,150 --> 00:11:10,810
Shize means well, doesn't he?

233
00:11:12,910 --> 00:11:13,790
Means well?

234
00:11:15,460 --> 00:11:16,890
Didn't he mean well back then

235
00:11:16,890 --> 00:11:19,030
when he offered to help take care of Yuan?

236
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:20,360
And what was the result?

237
00:11:22,130 --> 00:11:23,290
We can't afford

238
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,560
his kind of good intentions.

239
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:30,630
I'm sorry.

240
00:11:32,890 --> 00:11:33,700
Shize,

241
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:34,630
you go back.

242
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:36,100
You've been tired for so long.

243
00:11:36,100 --> 00:11:36,960
You go back.

244
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,790
Go back.

245
00:11:37,790 --> 00:11:39,250
Hurry, get back to your work.

246
00:11:39,250 --> 00:11:40,840
Stay away from our family from now on.

247
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,630
Those who get close to you

248
00:11:41,630 --> 00:11:42,700
never end up well!

249
00:11:42,700 --> 00:11:43,200
What are you doing?

250
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,150
You've already got Yuan killed.

251
00:11:44,150 --> 00:11:45,370
Don't harm anyone else!

252
00:11:45,370 --> 00:11:46,170
Shize.

253
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,440
Look at what you said!

254
00:12:49,210 --> 00:12:50,000
Hello?

255
00:12:50,250 --> 00:12:51,050
Lili.

256
00:12:51,250 --> 00:12:52,500
How was the tutoring today?

257
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:53,550
How did it go?

258
00:12:54,310 --> 00:12:55,450
Today is another day

259
00:12:55,480 --> 00:12:57,000
of unrequited love.

260
00:12:57,050 --> 00:12:58,250
Did you confess to him?

261
00:12:58,250 --> 00:12:58,960
Not yet.

262
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:00,600
That would scare him away.

263
00:13:00,650 --> 00:13:02,050
Then why did you say that?

264
00:13:03,510 --> 00:13:05,390
I asked him silently in my heart.

265
00:13:06,460 --> 00:13:08,010
Didn't you two go to a cafe

266
00:13:08,010 --> 00:13:08,790
on a date?

267
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:11,150
How did you know?

268
00:13:11,250 --> 00:13:12,860
It's all over the internet.

269
00:13:13,510 --> 00:13:15,310
Let me tell you something funny.

270
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,820
While skateboarding, Fu Zhengchu

271
00:13:16,820 --> 00:13:18,220
saw the photos of you two,

272
00:13:18,290 --> 00:13:19,120
got mesmerized,

273
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:20,460
and fell into a pit.

274
00:13:20,890 --> 00:13:21,820
Is it serious?

275
00:13:22,250 --> 00:13:23,340
He's fine.

276
00:13:23,800 --> 00:13:24,870
He just somehow

277
00:13:24,890 --> 00:13:26,360
ended up with a lifesaver.

278
00:13:26,390 --> 00:13:27,620
She called an ambulance for him

279
00:13:27,620 --> 00:13:29,410
and ran around taking care of everything,
including the hospital bills.

280
00:13:29,410 --> 00:13:30,890
So considerate.

281
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:33,000
He's lying in the hospital now,

282
00:13:33,120 --> 00:13:34,290
acting like an emperor,

283
00:13:34,290 --> 00:13:36,050
bossing me around.

284
00:13:36,050 --> 00:13:36,750
Tang Lin!

285
00:13:37,410 --> 00:13:38,270
I'm hungry.

286
00:13:40,390 --> 00:13:41,220
Heard that?

287
00:13:41,250 --> 00:13:42,910
The emperor has spoken again.

288
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,820
Are you at the hospital?

289
00:13:44,820 --> 00:13:45,600
Yes.

290
00:13:46,050 --> 00:13:46,960
Hurry and go to EAW

291
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,410
to look at the photos of you and Fu Shize.

292
00:13:48,410 --> 00:13:50,000
The netizens are going crazy.

293
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:50,790
Okay.

294
00:13:51,050 --> 00:13:51,860
Bye-bye.

295
00:14:06,620 --> 00:14:09,670
These are actually pretty good photos.

296
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,820
I bet 50 cents they're colleagues.

297
00:14:13,820 --> 00:14:15,130
Are you sure it's not her brother?

298
00:14:15,130 --> 00:14:16,820
Dating is fine,

299
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:18,300
[Perfect match! $200 from me.]
[Snacks out; stay tuned! Next.]

300
00:14:16,820 --> 00:14:18,130
but don't delay the updates, hear me?

301
00:14:18,130 --> 00:14:19,890
Next update, I want to see you two
appear together next update.

302
00:14:18,340 --> 00:14:19,220
[Older or younger cousin?
Three minutes to lie.]

303
00:14:19,370 --> 00:14:21,120
[I wanna see you appear together
next update. Don't make me beg!]

304
00:14:19,890 --> 00:14:21,290
I'm late. Can someone explain?

305
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,870
[Best wishes!]

306
00:14:21,290 --> 00:14:23,050
As long as you're happy. Congratulations.

307
00:14:22,930 --> 00:14:23,480
[Alright, I approve of this match.]

308
00:14:23,050 --> 00:14:24,940
What a match. Here's 200 for the wedding.

309
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,040
[Just a stranger who wandered into frame.
OP, share the original for proof.]

310
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:26,370
[Front row]

311
00:14:24,990 --> 00:14:27,020
It's blurry. Obviously a relative.

312
00:14:26,370 --> 00:14:27,280
[Doesn't Idle Cloud
have a younger brother?]

313
00:14:27,050 --> 00:14:28,270
Doesn't Idle Cloud
have a younger brother?

314
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,150
[Are you sure it's not her brother?]

315
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:29,340
Okay, next one.

316
00:14:29,910 --> 00:14:31,720
So embarrassing.

317
00:15:06,570 --> 00:15:09,300
[Jiang Yuan] [The total score
indicates a severe depressive tendency.]

318
00:15:22,290 --> 00:15:23,100
Have you been

319
00:15:24,960 --> 00:15:26,560
under a lot of stress lately?

320
00:15:27,750 --> 00:15:28,480
No.

321
00:15:33,510 --> 00:15:35,220
Maybe it's because my paper is due soon,

322
00:15:35,220 --> 00:15:36,720
so I'm a bit anxious.

323
00:15:37,460 --> 00:15:38,240
It's fine.

324
00:15:49,700 --> 00:15:51,250
There are 3 kinds of medicine in total.

325
00:15:51,250 --> 00:15:52,890
Take this bottle in the morning,

326
00:15:52,890 --> 00:15:54,820
and the other two boxes before bed.

327
00:15:55,050 --> 00:15:56,310
Make sure to take them.

328
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,730
I'll remind you too.

329
00:16:01,860 --> 00:16:02,890
Got it.

330
00:16:12,020 --> 00:16:13,680
Your dad specifically told me

331
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:15,840
to take good care of you.

332
00:16:19,510 --> 00:16:20,710
If you need anything,

333
00:16:21,820 --> 00:16:22,960
you must tell me.

334
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,240
Xia.

335
00:17:05,510 --> 00:17:07,160
You didn't go to the hospital?

336
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:09,220
Tang Lin told me Fu Zhengchu fell.

337
00:17:09,550 --> 00:17:11,010
I just finished checking in a guest.

338
00:17:11,010 --> 00:17:12,130
I'm about to go.

339
00:17:12,150 --> 00:17:13,250
He just broke a bone.

340
00:17:13,250 --> 00:17:14,460
He always walks around
with his head in the clouds.

341
00:17:14,460 --> 00:17:16,520
It's bound to happen sooner or later.

342
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:19,220
What happened to your arm?

343
00:17:19,579 --> 00:17:20,980
It's nothing. This is...

344
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:26,140
A sweet mark.

345
00:17:28,010 --> 00:17:28,590
It's fine.

346
00:17:28,590 --> 00:17:30,110
Hurry and go see your brother.

347
00:17:30,110 --> 00:17:30,920
I'll get going then.

348
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:31,750
We'll talk later.

349
00:17:31,750 --> 00:17:32,180
Okay.

350
00:17:42,140 --> 00:17:44,180
I was so close.

351
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:47,610
If only I were a little braver.

352
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:54,780
After the exam,

353
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:57,360
I'll confess my feelings.

354
00:18:04,550 --> 00:18:05,480
Welcome home.

355
00:18:05,530 --> 00:18:06,990
You've worked hard today.

356
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,270
Have a good rest at home.

357
00:18:08,270 --> 00:18:09,050
Wishing you

358
00:18:09,050 --> 00:18:10,110
a wonderful night.

359
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:08,590
I... I...

360
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:51,000
Stay away from our family from now on.

361
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:51,790
Those who get close to you

362
00:19:51,790 --> 00:19:52,880
never end up well!

363
00:19:53,590 --> 00:19:54,740
You've already got Yuan killed.

364
00:19:54,740 --> 00:19:56,070
Don't harm anyone else!

365
00:20:56,790 --> 00:20:57,810
Are you home?

366
00:20:58,270 --> 00:20:59,610
How is your family?

367
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:02,090
Thank you for today.

368
00:21:33,790 --> 00:21:34,680
Morning, Lili.

369
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:35,420
Morning.

370
00:21:38,580 --> 00:21:39,270
Xia,

371
00:21:39,330 --> 00:21:40,850
I'm in a hurry to get to work.

372
00:21:40,850 --> 00:21:42,050
I'll get going now.

373
00:21:42,050 --> 00:21:42,590
Bye-bye.

374
00:21:46,110 --> 00:21:46,640
Bye-bye.

375
00:21:50,220 --> 00:21:51,050
Yun Li, you're here.

376
00:21:51,050 --> 00:21:52,510
Shize hasn't arrived yet.

377
00:21:52,750 --> 00:21:53,550
Really?

378
00:22:16,530 --> 00:22:17,250
Morning.

379
00:22:20,550 --> 00:22:21,180
Yun Li, you're here.

380
00:22:21,180 --> 00:22:22,110
Morning, Wanqi.

381
00:22:31,460 --> 00:22:33,550
Did you see the breakfast on the table?

382
00:22:33,550 --> 00:22:34,790
I brought it for you.

383
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:37,330
No.

384
00:22:37,980 --> 00:22:40,180
That sounds like I'm asking for credit.

385
00:22:46,010 --> 00:22:47,250
I brought you breakfast.

386
00:22:47,250 --> 00:22:48,310
Remember to eat it.

387
00:23:30,420 --> 00:23:31,030
Yeah.

388
00:23:31,180 --> 00:23:32,010
It should be like this.

389
00:23:32,010 --> 00:23:33,690
How can you say it's not written?

390
00:23:33,690 --> 00:23:35,280
I was too busy then.

391
00:23:36,030 --> 00:23:36,660
Look.

392
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:38,640
Isn't this Yun Li?

393
00:23:38,900 --> 00:23:39,530
What is it?

394
00:23:39,530 --> 00:23:40,480
Is it her?

395
00:23:40,850 --> 00:23:41,440
Wait a minute.

396
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:43,330
I'll send it to the group
so you can all see.

397
00:23:43,330 --> 00:23:43,660
Okay.

398
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:44,680
Let me see.

399
00:23:44,680 --> 00:23:45,510
Do you see it?

400
00:23:45,510 --> 00:23:46,240
What is it?

401
00:23:46,240 --> 00:23:47,330
Yun Li is just dating.

402
00:23:47,330 --> 00:23:48,680
How'd this end up trending?

403
00:23:48,680 --> 00:23:49,330
This guy

404
00:23:49,330 --> 00:23:50,740
looks a bit familiar.

405
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:52,400
Isn't this Shize?

406
00:23:52,840 --> 00:23:54,160
I didn't recognize him.

407
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,070
It really is him.

408
00:23:55,070 --> 00:23:56,250
Isn't this great?

409
00:23:56,250 --> 00:23:57,930
Handsome guy and beautiful girl,
what a match.

410
00:23:57,930 --> 00:23:58,390
Right?

411
00:23:58,460 --> 00:23:59,960
Look how sweet they are.

412
00:24:00,070 --> 00:24:00,790
Mr. Zhang,

413
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:01,860
you should try harder too.

414
00:24:01,860 --> 00:24:02,880
I...

415
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:25,350
Shize,

416
00:24:25,350 --> 00:24:26,420
you're finally here.

417
00:24:26,420 --> 00:24:27,220
I've been looking for you all morning.

418
00:24:27,220 --> 00:24:28,950
I need your help with a problem.

419
00:24:31,070 --> 00:24:32,610
Run another stability test

420
00:24:33,250 --> 00:24:35,110
on the new headset's feedback data.

421
00:24:35,110 --> 00:24:37,610
Focus on rendering latency

422
00:24:37,760 --> 00:24:38,450
and the optimization

423
00:24:38,450 --> 00:24:40,050
of the face tracking system.

424
00:24:40,700 --> 00:24:41,070
Okay.

425
00:24:41,160 --> 00:24:42,070
Thanks, Shize.

426
00:24:42,510 --> 00:24:43,610
Are you feeling unwell?

427
00:24:43,610 --> 00:24:45,180
You look terrible.

428
00:24:46,550 --> 00:24:48,180
I'm fine. Get back to work.

429
00:24:48,480 --> 00:24:49,350
I'll get going then, Shize.

430
00:24:49,350 --> 00:24:50,350
Get some rest.

431
00:25:13,500 --> 00:25:15,030
Let me help you pick them up.

432
00:25:15,850 --> 00:25:17,030
Thank you, Jiameng.

433
00:25:17,330 --> 00:25:17,990
No problem.

434
00:25:25,420 --> 00:25:26,250
What happened to your arm?

435
00:25:26,250 --> 00:25:27,050
Are you hurt?

436
00:25:28,350 --> 00:25:29,160
I'm fine.

437
00:25:31,550 --> 00:25:32,550
By the way, Yun Li.

438
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,310
I saw the photos.

439
00:25:35,610 --> 00:25:36,660
What photos?

440
00:25:36,850 --> 00:25:38,550
The photos of you and Shize
being all lovey-dovey.

441
00:25:38,550 --> 00:25:39,590
Everyone is shipping you two.

442
00:25:39,590 --> 00:25:40,700
It's so sweet.

443
00:25:42,110 --> 00:25:42,910
Yun Li,

444
00:25:43,310 --> 00:25:44,720
you're so good at keeping secrets.

445
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:46,310
You didn't even tell us you're dating.

446
00:25:46,310 --> 00:25:47,110
No.

447
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:48,810
Don't listen to their nonsense.

448
00:25:48,810 --> 00:25:49,410
We...

449
00:25:49,430 --> 00:25:51,170
We're not dating yet.

450
00:25:52,850 --> 00:25:54,270
Not yet?

451
00:25:54,850 --> 00:25:56,250
That means it's happening soon.

452
00:25:56,250 --> 00:25:57,660
How far along are you with it?

453
00:25:57,660 --> 00:25:59,980
Are you just one step away,

454
00:25:59,980 --> 00:26:02,110
waiting for someone to confess first?

455
00:26:02,570 --> 00:26:03,880
I... I'll get back to work.

456
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:04,680
Thanks.

457
00:26:13,590 --> 00:26:15,500
Why hasn't he replied yet?

458
00:26:20,880 --> 00:26:21,680
Yun Li.

459
00:26:22,700 --> 00:26:23,500
Ms. Fang.

460
00:26:24,110 --> 00:26:25,510
I was just looking for you.

461
00:26:25,510 --> 00:26:25,810
The shop tour video

462
00:26:25,810 --> 00:26:27,660
you made for the company last time

463
00:26:27,660 --> 00:26:28,990
worked really well as promotion.

464
00:26:28,990 --> 00:26:29,610
Now that the company

465
00:26:29,610 --> 00:26:31,170
has launched Light Chaser,

466
00:26:31,250 --> 00:26:32,650
we want to shoot a new promotional video.

467
00:26:32,650 --> 00:26:33,460
I'll leave this task to you.

468
00:26:33,460 --> 00:26:34,050
Is that okay?

469
00:26:34,050 --> 00:26:35,070
Sure, no problem.

470
00:26:36,110 --> 00:26:37,250
Let's go to the meeting room

471
00:26:37,250 --> 00:26:38,580
and talk about the plan.

472
00:26:38,660 --> 00:26:39,350
Ms. Fang,

473
00:26:39,350 --> 00:26:40,750
can you wait a moment?

474
00:26:40,750 --> 00:26:41,500
It won't take long.

475
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:42,020
Hurry.

476
00:26:43,290 --> 00:26:44,900
[Meeting Room]

477
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:50,380
A sense of reality is a must,

478
00:26:50,380 --> 00:26:51,550
along with a high-tech feel.

479
00:26:51,550 --> 00:26:53,270
This is our focus this time,

480
00:26:53,660 --> 00:26:54,880
including the pacing.

481
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:55,480
You need

482
00:26:55,480 --> 00:26:56,160
to put all of this in

483
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:57,490
when you edit the video.

484
00:26:58,250 --> 00:26:59,220
As for the shots,

485
00:26:59,220 --> 00:26:59,720
I think

486
00:26:59,720 --> 00:27:00,880
you should be quite good at this.

487
00:27:00,880 --> 00:27:01,420
Because I saw

488
00:27:01,420 --> 00:27:02,380
the video you shot before,

489
00:27:02,380 --> 00:27:03,640
and it was pretty good.

490
00:27:04,110 --> 00:27:04,770
Okay.

491
00:27:04,770 --> 00:27:06,180
That's all for now.

492
00:27:06,180 --> 00:27:07,310
Thanks for your hard work, Yun Li.

493
00:27:07,310 --> 00:27:07,980
No problem at all.

494
00:27:07,980 --> 00:27:08,810
I will definitely do a good job

495
00:27:08,810 --> 00:27:09,660
on this promotional video.

496
00:27:09,660 --> 00:27:10,350
Don't worry.

497
00:27:10,350 --> 00:27:11,700
I'll get back to work then.

498
00:27:11,700 --> 00:27:12,070
Okay.

499
00:27:12,070 --> 00:27:14,400
Put it together
and send it to me tomorrow.

500
00:27:21,500 --> 00:27:23,220
He's already at the company.

501
00:27:23,250 --> 00:27:25,250
Why hasn't he replied to my message?

502
00:27:25,330 --> 00:27:26,730
Is he doing it on purpose?

503
00:27:29,500 --> 00:27:31,220
It started raining so suddenly.

504
00:27:31,220 --> 00:27:31,940
Yeah.

505
00:27:31,940 --> 00:27:33,740
I didn't even bring an umbrella.

506
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:27,400
Fu Shize!

507
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:33,400
You came to the office today.

508
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:34,800
But I didn't run into you.

509
00:28:45,060 --> 00:28:46,660
Do you need me for something?

510
00:28:48,440 --> 00:28:49,050
Yeah.

511
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:51,010
Kind of.

512
00:28:52,350 --> 00:28:54,210
I've been waiting for you all day.

513
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:58,720
I'll walk you to the parking lot.

514
00:29:06,110 --> 00:29:06,750
No need.

515
00:29:14,650 --> 00:29:16,190
Don't get soaked.

516
00:29:30,660 --> 00:29:31,310
You...

517
00:29:35,790 --> 00:29:36,900
You like me?

518
00:29:40,330 --> 00:29:41,330
I'm pursuing you.

519
00:29:42,550 --> 00:29:43,680
Is that not allowed?

520
00:29:54,850 --> 00:29:55,680
Those who get close to you

521
00:29:55,680 --> 00:29:56,750
never end up well!

522
00:29:56,960 --> 00:29:58,050
You've already got Yuan killed.

523
00:29:58,050 --> 00:29:59,380
Don't harm anyone else!

524
00:30:25,880 --> 00:30:26,530
Sorry.

525
00:30:29,460 --> 00:30:30,350
Maybe my behavior

526
00:30:30,350 --> 00:30:31,680
gave you the wrong idea.

527
00:30:34,270 --> 00:30:34,940
I'm not looking

528
00:30:34,940 --> 00:30:35,940
to date right now.

529
00:30:42,550 --> 00:30:43,220
I'm sorry.

530
00:31:00,950 --> 00:31:04,600
♪ Dust upon time ♪

531
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:07,990
♪ Every step soft and slow ♪

532
00:31:09,800 --> 00:31:12,980
♪ The room holds my profile ♪

533
00:31:13,910 --> 00:31:17,300
♪ Passing no verdict for anyone ♪

534
00:31:18,230 --> 00:31:22,250
♪ Wind brushes the half-drawn curtain ♪

535
00:31:22,650 --> 00:31:26,300
♪ Carrying away unneeded words ♪

536
00:31:26,730 --> 00:31:30,790
♪ Is it true that the more we wish
for what we want ♪

537
00:31:30,810 --> 00:31:35,060
♪ The more we tend to fall short? ♪

538
00:31:35,350 --> 00:31:39,550
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

539
00:31:39,740 --> 00:31:43,310
♪ Afraid you'll see right through me ♪

540
00:31:43,910 --> 00:31:47,800
♪ Does the fading light ♪

541
00:31:47,830 --> 00:31:51,880
♪ Decide it won't be whole? ♪

542
00:31:52,660 --> 00:31:56,700
♪ Half of my thoughts ♪

543
00:31:56,730 --> 00:32:00,490
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

544
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:04,990
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

545
00:32:05,010 --> 00:32:09,420
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

546
00:32:10,730 --> 00:32:15,810
♪ Half the tale remains ♪

547
00:32:31,080 --> 00:32:33,180
♪ Half my clinging stays ♪

548
00:32:33,210 --> 00:32:34,980
♪ Half this world ♪

549
00:32:35,360 --> 00:32:38,480
♪ Both form something brand-new ♪

550
00:32:39,260 --> 00:32:41,480
♪ You leave your words half-spoken ♪

551
00:32:41,820 --> 00:32:43,730
♪ Another half are lost ♪

552
00:32:43,760 --> 00:32:47,500
♪ Where can I peek for the rest? ♪

553
00:32:47,930 --> 00:32:49,930
♪ Half drifting apart ♪

554
00:32:50,270 --> 00:32:52,270
♪ Half a hug we share ♪

555
00:32:52,510 --> 00:32:56,170
♪ A goodnight too late ♪

556
00:32:56,460 --> 00:32:58,650
♪ Let the moon be half-lit ♪

557
00:32:58,890 --> 00:33:01,180
♪ Clouds half-hidden too ♪

558
00:33:02,670 --> 00:33:10,430
♪ Let me brave once more ♪

559
00:33:28,290 --> 00:33:28,880
Sir,

560
00:33:28,910 --> 00:33:30,310
I'll take 2 packs of this.

561
00:33:30,680 --> 00:33:31,770
Why 2 packs?

562
00:33:32,420 --> 00:33:33,620
I want to give you one.

563
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:36,480
No need.

564
00:33:37,540 --> 00:33:38,670
But I insist.

565
00:33:41,030 --> 00:33:41,980
You've paid

566
00:33:41,980 --> 00:33:43,220
many times for me.

567
00:33:44,110 --> 00:33:45,920
I feel like I owe you money.

568
00:33:49,440 --> 00:33:50,740
If that's the reason,

569
00:33:52,810 --> 00:33:54,340
then let's keep it this way.

570
00:34:07,690 --> 00:34:10,620
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

571
00:34:10,639 --> 00:34:12,800
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

572
00:34:14,670 --> 00:34:17,620
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

573
00:34:17,650 --> 00:34:19,940
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

574
00:34:21,020 --> 00:34:24,590
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

575
00:34:24,760 --> 00:34:27,620
♪ To meet the moon ♪

576
00:34:27,639 --> 00:34:30,570
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

577
00:34:30,600 --> 00:34:33,489
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

578
00:34:33,510 --> 00:34:37,670
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

579
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:40,870
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

580
00:34:40,889 --> 00:34:44,630
♪ Love gives us all ♪

